						 <p>urgh that's a terrible excuse! Scrap the picture altogether, I got the gist of things even when just reading it, it's not exactly rocket science ed</p> <p>Edit the damn thing already :P I agree with yoric totaly because a mind-controlling nonhuman written by <em>Edgoddamncrab</em> should be one of the best things on the site instead of one of the weakest.</p> 
