				<wikidot:authorName>Edcrab</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>369319</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>"Linking" consists of it actively making physical contact and asserting direct control over a lifeform. It can still project on people, but we're not as susceptible.</p> <p>See, that makes me think we need to swap out the picture rather than having none, because if people can miss that distinction even when there's a captioned picture of it taking place, there must already be a definite hole in the article…</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
